      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>“Temple Anniversary Prayer” by Rabbi Roland Gittelsohn was written sometime between 1953 and 1962, likely for Temple Israel (Boston, Massachusetts), where he served from 1953 until 1977. Unfortunately, no more information was provided by Rabbi David Bial in his anthology, <tei:hi rend="italic">An Offering of Prayer</tei:hi> (1962), p. 52, from where this prayer was transcribed. If you know more, please leave a comment or contact us.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
